# Upscaling / ONNX rules

- Prefer `DmlExecutionProvider`; fall back to CPU.
- Models live under `%USERPROFILE%\Downloads\FrameForge\models\`.
- Use tiling; expose progress callbacks.
- Support stop/resume via frame checkpoints.
- Re-encode/remux preserving **original audio**; keep metadata when possible.
- Temp frames under `%USERPROFILE%\Downloads\FrameForge\temp\`.
